{"route":"/docs/5.1/components/scrollspy/","version":"5.1","renderedVersion":"5.1","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Scrollspy","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Automatically update Bootstrap navigation or list group components based on scroll position to indicate which link is currently active in the viewport."},"blocks":[{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","en":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Scrollspy has a few requirements to function properly:"},{"id":"how-it-works--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-1","type":"item","en":"It must be used on a Bootstrap <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/components/navs-tabs/\">nav component</a> or <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/components/list-group/\">list group</a>."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-2","type":"item","en":"Scrollspy requires <code>position: relative;</code> on the element you’re spying on, usually the <code>&lt;body&gt;</code>."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-3","type":"item","en":"Anchors (<code>&lt;a&gt;</code>) are required and must point to an element with that <code>id</code>."}]}]},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"When successfully implemented, your nav or list group will update accordingly, moving the <code>.active</code> class from one item to the next based on their associated targets."},{"id":"how-it-works--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"scrollable-containers-and-keyboard-access","type":"heading","en":"Scrollable containers and keyboard access","level":3},{"id":"scrollable-containers-and-keyboard-access--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"If you’re making a scrollable container (other than the <code>&lt;body&gt;</code>), be sure to have a <code>height</code> set and <code>overflow-y: scroll;</code> applied to it—alongside a <code>tabindex=&quot;0&quot;</code> to ensure keyboard access."}]},{"id":"example-in-navbar","type":"heading","en":"Example in navbar","level":2},{"id":"example-in-navbar--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Scroll the area below the navbar and watch the active class change. The dropdown items will be highlighted as well."},{"id":"example-in-navbar--example-1","type":"demo","key":"628567608b6b1e81b204","height":174,"anchors":["navbar-example2","scrollspyHeading1","scrollspyHeading2","scrollspyHeading3","scrollspyHeading4","scrollspyHeading5"]},{"id":"example-in-navbar--code-1","type":"code","value":"<nav id=\"navbar-example2\" class=\"navbar navbar-light bg-light px-3\">\n  <a class=\"navbar-brand\" href=\"#\">Navbar</a>\n  <ul class=\"nav nav-pills\">\n    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n      <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#scrollspyHeading1\">First</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n      <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#scrollspyHeading2\">Second</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n      <a class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" href=\"#\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Dropdown</a>\n      <ul class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n        <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#scrollspyHeading3\">Third</a></li>\n        <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#scrollspyHeading4\">Fourth</a></li>\n        <li><hr class=\"dropdown-divider\"></li>\n        <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#scrollspyHeading5\">Fifth</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</nav>\n<div data-bs-spy=\"scroll\" data-bs-target=\"#navbar-example2\" data-bs-offset=\"0\" class=\"scrollspy-example\" tabindex=\"0\">\n  <h4 id=\"scrollspyHeading1\">First heading</h4>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h4 id=\"scrollspyHeading2\">Second heading</h4>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h4 id=\"scrollspyHeading3\">Third heading</h4>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h4 id=\"scrollspyHeading4\">Fourth heading</h4>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h4 id=\"scrollspyHeading5\">Fifth heading</h4>\n  <p>...</p>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"example-with-nested-nav","type":"heading","en":"Example with nested nav","level":2},{"id":"example-with-nested-nav--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Scrollspy also works with nested <code>.nav</code>s. If a nested <code>.nav</code> is <code>.active</code>, its parents will also be <code>.active</code>. Scroll the area next to the navbar and watch the active class change."},{"id":"example-with-nested-nav--example-1","type":"demo","key":"a76e1ff494849ff77c88","height":147,"anchors":["navbar-example3","item-1","item-1-1","item-1-2","item-2","item-3","item-3-1","item-3-2"]},{"id":"example-with-nested-nav--code-1","type":"code","value":"<nav id=\"navbar-example3\" class=\"navbar navbar-light bg-light flex-column align-items-stretch p-3\">\n  <a class=\"navbar-brand\" href=\"#\">Navbar</a>\n  <nav class=\"nav nav-pills flex-column\">\n    <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#item-1\">Item 1</a>\n    <nav class=\"nav nav-pills flex-column\">\n      <a class=\"nav-link ms-3 my-1\" href=\"#item-1-1\">Item 1-1</a>\n      <a class=\"nav-link ms-3 my-1\" href=\"#item-1-2\">Item 1-2</a>\n    </nav>\n    <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#item-2\">Item 2</a>\n    <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#item-3\">Item 3</a>\n    <nav class=\"nav nav-pills flex-column\">\n      <a class=\"nav-link ms-3 my-1\" href=\"#item-3-1\">Item 3-1</a>\n      <a class=\"nav-link ms-3 my-1\" href=\"#item-3-2\">Item 3-2</a>\n    </nav>\n  </nav>\n</nav>\n\n<div data-bs-spy=\"scroll\" data-bs-target=\"#navbar-example3\" data-bs-offset=\"0\" tabindex=\"0\">\n  <h4 id=\"item-1\">Item 1</h4>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h5 id=\"item-1-1\">Item 1-1</h5>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h5 id=\"item-1-2\">Item 1-2</h5>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h4 id=\"item-2\">Item 2</h4>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h4 id=\"item-3\">Item 3</h4>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h5 id=\"item-3-1\">Item 3-1</h5>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h5 id=\"item-3-2\">Item 3-2</h5>\n  <p>...</p>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"example-with-list-group","type":"heading","en":"Example with list-group","level":2},{"id":"example-with-list-group--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Scrollspy also works with <code>.list-group</code>s. Scroll the area next to the list group and watch the active class change."},{"id":"example-with-list-group--example-1","type":"demo","key":"2d6a762a04bac0532286","height":260,"anchors":["list-example","list-item-1","list-item-2","list-item-3","list-item-4"]},{"id":"example-with-list-group--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div id=\"list-example\" class=\"list-group\">\n  <a class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\" href=\"#list-item-1\">Item 1</a>\n  <a class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\" href=\"#list-item-2\">Item 2</a>\n  <a class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\" href=\"#list-item-3\">Item 3</a>\n  <a class=\"list-group-item list-group-item-action\" href=\"#list-item-4\">Item 4</a>\n</div>\n<div data-bs-spy=\"scroll\" data-bs-target=\"#list-example\" data-bs-offset=\"0\" class=\"scrollspy-example\" tabindex=\"0\">\n  <h4 id=\"list-item-1\">Item 1</h4>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h4 id=\"list-item-2\">Item 2</h4>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h4 id=\"list-item-3\">Item 3</h4>\n  <p>...</p>\n  <h4 id=\"list-item-4\">Item 4</h4>\n  <p>...</p>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"usage","type":"heading","en":"Usage","level":2},{"id":"via-data-attributes","type":"heading","en":"Via data attributes","level":3},{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"To easily add scrollspy behavior to your topbar navigation, add <code>data-bs-spy=&quot;scroll&quot;</code> to the element you want to spy on (most typically this would be the <code>&lt;body&gt;</code>). Then add the <code>data-bs-target</code> attribute with the ID or class of the parent element of any Bootstrap <code>.nav</code> component."},{"id":"via-data-attributes--code-1","type":"code","value":"body {\n  position: relative;\n}","language":"css"},{"id":"via-data-attributes--code-2","type":"code","value":"<body data-bs-spy=\"scroll\" data-bs-target=\"#navbar-example\">\n  ...\n  <div id=\"navbar-example\">\n    <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n      ...\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  ...\n</body>","language":"html"},{"id":"via-javascript","type":"heading","en":"Via JavaScript","level":3},{"id":"via-javascript--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"After adding <code>position: relative;</code> in your CSS, call the scrollspy via JavaScript:"},{"id":"via-javascript--code-1","type":"code","value":"var scrollSpy = new bootstrap.ScrollSpy(document.body, {\n  target: '#navbar-example'\n})","language":"js"},{"id":"via-javascript--note-1","type":"note","tone":"danger","body":[{"id":"resolvable-id-targets-required","type":"heading","en":"Resolvable ID targets required","level":4},{"id":"resolvable-id-targets-required--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"Navbar links must have resolvable id targets. For example, a <code>&lt;a href=&quot;#home&quot;&gt;home&lt;/a&gt;</code> must correspond to something in the DOM like <code>&lt;div id=&quot;home&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</code>."}]},{"id":"resolvable-id-targets-required--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"non-visible-target-elements-ignored","type":"heading","en":"Non-visible target elements ignored","level":4},{"id":"non-visible-target-elements-ignored--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"Target elements that are not visible will be ignored and their corresponding nav items will never be highlighted."}]},{"id":"methods","type":"heading","en":"Methods","level":3},{"id":"refresh","type":"heading","en":"refresh","level":4},{"id":"refresh--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"When using scrollspy in conjunction with adding or removing of elements from the DOM, you’ll need to call the refresh method like so:"},{"id":"refresh--code-1","type":"code","value":"var dataSpyList = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-bs-spy=\"scroll\"]'))\ndataSpyList.forEach(function (dataSpyEl) {\n  bootstrap.ScrollSpy.getInstance(dataSpyEl)\n    .refresh()\n})","language":"js"},{"id":"dispose","type":"heading","en":"dispose","level":4},{"id":"dispose--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Destroys an element’s scrollspy. (Removes stored data on the DOM element)"},{"id":"getinstance","type":"heading","en":"getInstance","level":4},{"id":"getinstance--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<em>Static</em> method which allows you to get the scrollspy instance associated with a DOM element"},{"id":"getinstance--code-1","type":"code","value":"var scrollSpyContentEl = document.getElementById('content')\nvar scrollSpy = bootstrap.ScrollSpy.getInstance(scrollSpyContentEl) // Returns a Bootstrap scrollspy instance","language":"js"},{"id":"getorcreateinstance","type":"heading","en":"getOrCreateInstance","level":4},{"id":"getorcreateinstance--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<em>Static</em> method which allows you to get the scrollspy instance associated with a DOM element, or create a new one in case it wasn’t initialized"},{"id":"getorcreateinstance--code-1","type":"code","value":"var scrollSpyContentEl = document.getElementById('content')\nvar scrollSpy = bootstrap.ScrollSpy.getOrCreateInstance(scrollSpyContentEl) // Returns a Bootstrap scrollspy instance","language":"js"},{"id":"options","type":"heading","en":"Options","level":3},{"id":"options--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Options can be passed via data attributes or JavaScript. For data attributes, append the option name to <code>data-bs-</code>, as in <code>data-bs-offset=&quot;&quot;</code>."},{"id":"options--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Name"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Type"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Default"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>offset</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"number"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>10</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"Pixels to offset from top when calculating position of scroll."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>method</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"string"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>auto</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-13","type":"paragraph","en":"Finds which section the spied element is in. <code>auto</code> will choose the best method to get scroll coordinates. <code>offset</code> will use the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/getBoundingClientRect\"><code>Element.getBoundingClientRect()</code></a> method to get scroll coordinates. <code>position</code> will use the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/offsetTop\"><code>HTMLElement.offsetTop</code></a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/offsetLeft\"><code>HTMLElement.offsetLeft</code></a> properties to get scroll coordinates."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>target</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-15","type":"paragraph","en":"string | jQuery object | DOM element"}]},{"type":"td","body":[]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-16","type":"paragraph","en":"Specifies element to apply Scrollspy plugin."}]}]}]},{"id":"events","type":"heading","en":"Events","level":3},{"id":"events--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Event type"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>activate.bs.scrollspy</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"This event fires on the scroll element whenever a new item becomes activated by the scrollspy."}]}]}]},{"id":"events--code-1","type":"code","value":"var firstScrollSpyEl = document.querySelector('[data-bs-spy=\"scroll\"]')\nfirstScrollSpyEl.addEventListener('activate.bs.scrollspy', function () {\n  // do something...\n})","language":"js"}],"demos":[{"key":"628567608b6b1e81b204","html":"\n  <nav id=\"navbar-example2\" class=\"navbar navbar-light bg-light px-3\">\n    <a class=\"navbar-brand\" href=\"#\">Navbar</a>\n    <ul class=\"nav nav-pills\">\n      <li class=\"nav-item\">\n        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#scrollspyHeading1\">First</a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"nav-item\">\n        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#scrollspyHeading2\">Second</a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n        <a class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" href=\"#\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Dropdown</a>\n        <ul class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n          <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#scrollspyHeading3\">Third</a></li>\n          <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#scrollspyHeading4\">Fourth</a></li>\n          <li></li>\n          <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#scrollspyHeading5\">Fifth</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </nav>\n  <div data-bs-spy=\"scroll\" data-bs-target=\"#navbar-example2\" data-bs-offset=\"0\" class=\"scrollspy-example\" tabindex=\"0\">\n    <h4 id=\"scrollspyHeading1\">First heading</h4>\n    <p>This is some placeholder content for the scrollspy page. Note that as you scroll down the page, the appropriate navigation link is highligh